null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### What version of Hono are you using?\r\n\r\n4.5.6\r\n\r\n### What runtime/platform is your app running on?\r\n\r\nNode.js, Bun\r\n\r\n### What steps can reproduce the bug?\r\n\r\nWhen you try to validate a request whose Content-Type is `application/x-www-form-urlencoded; charset=UTF-8` with `hono/validator`, the value cannot be validated correctly.\r\n\r\ncode: \r\n\r\n```ts\r\nimport { Hono } from 'hono';\r\nimport { validator } from 'hono/validator';\r\n\r\nconst app = new Hono()\r\napp.post(\r\n  '/post',\r\n  validator('form', (value) => value),\r\n  (c) => {\r\n    return c.json({\r\n      validation_result: c.req.valid('form'),\r\n      formData: await c.req.formData(),\r\n    })\r\n  }\r\n)\r\n\r\nexport default app\r\n```\r\n\r\nrequest:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n$> curl -XPOST \\\r\n       -H 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded; charset=UTF-8' \\\r\n       -d 'a=foo&b=bar' \\\r\n    'http://localhost:3000'\r\n\r\n> { \"validation_result\": {}, \"formData\": { \"a\":\"foo\", \"b\":\"bar\" } }\r\n```\r\n\r\n### What is the expected behavior?\r\n\r\nThe value of validate_result and formData should be the same.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n$> curl -XPOST \\\r\n       -H 'Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded; charset=UTF-8' \\\r\n       -d 'a=foo&b=bar' \\\r\n    'http://localhost:3000'\r\n\r\n> { \"validation_result\": { \"a\":\"foo\", \"b\":\"bar\" }, \"formData\": { \"a\":\"foo\", \"b\":\"bar\" } }\r\n```\r\n\r\n### What do you see instead?\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Additional information\r\n\r\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"yusukebe","id":10682,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10682?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe","html_url":"https://github.com/yusukebe","followers_url":"http